# Run your first search: the commands of the tutorial's second terminal.
Output docs/user/assets/first-search.gif
Source docs/captures/_settings.tape
Type "export SEEK_SERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788"
Enter
Type "export SEEK_SERVER_TOKEN_VALUE=practice-token"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type 'seek web parallel "how do honeybees make honey"'
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "clear"
Enter
Type 'seek web parallel "how do honeybees make honey" -n 1 --json'
Enter
Sleep 5s
